["leaf",0]},{"t":"Parece que a morte deixa todos cegos sobre a verdade, não é?","e":"I guess death blinds everyone to the truth, doesn't it?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.826804,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"10ab7e78fe0ea5ed2adfde60a95776c5","i":"67092a00e8462e852a8417a2e3a0a32e","r":"5077426:6474655:620:2121550","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5077426","6474655","620"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Nós nunca vimos tanta coisa, mas também nunca fomos tão cegos.","e":"We never saw a lot, but also were never so blind.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.895573,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a802880134ee5ed054e206dffd34b2bc","i":"7aa723151500da00b3fd992928de6863","r":"4812996:9133606","c":"carlosalberto","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4812996","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4812996","b":"Tatoeba sentence #4812996 by carlosalberto; English translation #9133606 by acell","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/4812996","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Quais são as vossas fraquezas, os vossos pontos cegos?","e":"What are your weaknesses, your blind spots?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.923982,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"e3b822f3d8d3ac09701e08e7642aff78","i":"c0ae8c0432efe504b348e700a0a8b21e","r":"4724496:6555949:72:2916696","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4724496","6555949","72"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mostrou-lhe o que deviam ver, eles não são cegos.","e":"You've shown them where to look. They're not blind!","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.745113,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f76c7bb92fb3d7c06f8a260cfaaf8680","i":"9480c2ba0d831849364c187a3955ec4c","r":"3546278:6217108:393:421369","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3546278","6217108","393"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Acontece que sei onde estão todos os pontos cegos das câmaras de segurança.","e":"I happen to know where all the security cameras' blind spots are.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.913639,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"8886e577ebb503de2b9d5dc48ea129ac","i":"ac9771b2f12f5202be040a363a3e4d2f","r":"4724486:6409206:686:1857067","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4724486","6409206","686"],"w":["leaf",0]}],[{"t":"Sei que os cegos têm uma ligação especial com os cães.","e":"I'm told that blind people have a special connection with dogs.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.799195,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"762f9a2163fb4c135538176fc353e16c","i":"0ac0b7d4339bb90c1daf7cfcc6f89160","r":"4371334:6820077:64:2683501","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4371334","6820077","64"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Em terra de cegos, quem tem um olho é rei.","e":"In the kingdom of the blind, the man with one eye is the king.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.76662,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"750c655367303e3b509b45b4dba61d4e","i":"423be9c60acba17adf18319c3a5e14d3","r":"4145178:6427376:620:973564","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4145178","6427376","620"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O pequeno rapaz que podia fazer os mortos respirar e os cegos ver.","e":"The little boy who can make the dead breathe and the blind see.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.821559,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"96cb86f27ca3b630c9ac7a6ba587a277","i":"a21179c4d14df937d28c68b35f714a5c","r":"1002563:6648153:1027:2220355","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1002563","6648153","1027"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Se todos fossem cegos a polícia não seria necessária.","e":"If everyone's blind, the police won't be needed.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.836212,"version":"labse-cosi